source: tests/cli/snapshots.rs
---
List sync jobs

Usage: vendo jobs list [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --profile <name>               Use a specific account profile
      --status <status>              Filter by status (pending, running, completed, failed, cancelled)
      --debug                        Enable verbose request diagnostics
      --type <type>                  Filter by job type (import, export)
      --source <sourceId>            Filter by source ID
      --integration <integrationId>  Filter by destination ID
      --limit <n>                    Number of results [default: 20]
      --offset <n>                   Pagination offset [default: 0]
      --json                         Output raw JSON
      --output <field>               Print a single field per row (e.g. id)
  -h, --help                         Print help

Examples:
  $ vendo jobs list
  $ vendo jobs list --status running
  $ vendo jobs list --source <sourceId>
  $ vendo jobs list --output id
